  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5915.04 Final Cognitive Examination Process",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5915.04 Final Cognitive Examination Process.\n\n(a) The final cognitive examination shall be administered by the National Registry of Emergency Medical Technicians.\n\n(b) A candidate shall successfully complete the cognitive examination in accordance with the National Registry of Emergency Medical Technicians.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19; ss by #19553, eff 4-20-24",
